WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.900
We're back.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.650
Welcome home, you two.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.490
Here. Today's earnings from the Dungeon.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:13.120
Already deducted the equipment costs for our weapons and such.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.700
I appreciate your help.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:22.840
The two of you have been an invaluable asset to our Familia ever since you joined us.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.050
How kind of you to say.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.510
By the way, what are your plans for the quest you mentioned earlier?

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:31.970
We can take care of it ourselves, if necessary.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:36.720
Retrieving rare medicinal herbs from a deserted island... Sounds interesting, to say the least.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.060
Actually...

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:46.070
Master Miach has proposed bypassing the Guild and putting in a personal request with Bell and the others.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:47.690
The Hestia Familia?

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:48.900
How come?

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.820
A lot has happened recently, and their Familia has grown...

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.660
He'd like to congratulate them.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.500
I don't mean to argue, but...

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.870
Herbs from a deserted island would be made into a medicine of immense worth...

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.130
We're going to turn a profit, regardless of which Familia we ask to retrieve them.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:11.680
But Master Miach insists on doubling the reward for Bell and the others to celebrate.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:12.390
What?

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:13.850
And he wishes to pay them in advance.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:14.550
What?!

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.810
Essentially... it's an invitation for a relaxing vacation.

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:24.190
I'm beginning to understand why this Familia is always in debt...

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:25.820
That's Master Miach, for you.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:29.490
Is something the matter, ladies?

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.460
Glittering sunlight!

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.670
A blue ocean!

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.290
White, sandy beaches!

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:11.500
Welcome to Paradise Island!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:29.150
Here we are... on a deserted island named "Paradise"...

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.400
Yes. When you invited me here, I assumed it was some sort of joke.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:36.360
You helped us out big time during the War Game, Miss Elf!

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.320
Inviting you along was the least we could do to repay you!

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:40.780
What a load of bull...

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:46.500
Whose idea was it to rely on her for protection from any weird monsters that might be lurking around?

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:48.420
Listen here, Miss Supporter...!

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:52.500
The topics discussed at our Familia meetings are strictly confidential!

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:56.260
The entire island's supposed to be a treasure trove of rare herbs, right?

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.220
Yup, according to Miss Naaza.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:04.520
Rumor has it, a mysterious, potent herb called an "Everything Flower" lies at the center of the island.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:06.680
What exactly does it do?

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.480
As its name suggests, the herb has unbe-leaf-able capabilities.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:11.980
Was that a pun?!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.900
There are stories of people falling in love

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.530
and bathing in tubs of gold with the herb in their possession.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:19.200
Wow, that's amazing!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.030
Seems suspicious, if you ask me...

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:24.490
Regardless, we were called upon to complete this quest.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.950
Our job is to collect a supply of herbs and return home.

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:29.670
Let's start by splitting up and searching the island.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:34.630
Welf and I will head towards the forest. Everyone else should stick to the shore.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.260
The heck are you talkin' about, Bell?!

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.340
We came all this way to Paradise Island.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.050
Before we get to work, I say we go for a dip in the ocean!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.140
Yeah!

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.310
Y-yeah...!

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:53.060
Oh, but I... didn't bring a swimsuit with me.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.070
What?!

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:56.570
What on Earth were you thinking, Bell?!

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:58.610
How could you disappoint us like this, Master Bell?!

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.860
I'm sorry, I'm sorry! I don't know what I did wrong, but I'm sorry!

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.120
Smart move. Apologize now and ask questions later.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:05.410
Oh well!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.120
The rest of you go ahead and swim.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.870
Bell and I are busy keeping an eye on the bags together.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.460
Weren't you the one who wanted to go swimming in the first place?!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.420
Please allow me to look after Master Bell!

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.170
I thought you wanted to go seashell hunting or something!

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.840
Excuse me... I wouldn't mind looking after Master Bell...

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.680
Get your grubby tail off of him!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:24.760
S-sorry!

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:29.640
Well then, we'll just have to let Bell decide, won't we?!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.560
I propose a swimsuit contest!

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.520
Sounds good to me!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:37.730
Winner gets to spend the entire day hanging out alone with Bell?

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.150
Exactly what I was thinking!

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:42.360
M-may I participate, too?

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.160
Our contestants are currently preparing their change of clothes.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.330
What sort of exciting swimsuits do they have in store for us today?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.380
Perhaps I should have mentioned this earlier,

00:05:56.380 --> 00:06:00.090
but I'm surprised the Guild allowed you to leave Orario, Lady Hestia.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:03.880
Well, I might've asked Ganesha for a favor. Off the record, you know?

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:05.550
Seriously? Again?

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:09.470
What about the incident with the Kingdom of Rakia?

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.940
Don't be such a party pooper!

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:17.940
I refuse to be the only one left behind, especially when everyone else gets to go to Paradise Island!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.400
This is becoming an awfully bad habit of yours...

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.070
Whatever, it doesn't matter.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:24.950
In this swimsuit contest, I shall be the victor!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.160
Hestia has moved to the private changing area.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.120
Let's take a quick peek!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.250
Sneak...

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:37.590
Her swimsuit...?

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.920
If they think they can beat me with boring swimsuits like that, they are sorely mistaken.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:48.640
Besides, Bell and I share memories together that they don't even know about.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:52.930
After I hang out with Bell for the entire day, the two of us will finally...!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:57.360
I... want to be with you, Goddess.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.860
I feel the same way, Bell.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.570
You don't understand, Goddess.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:05.360
I want to spend the whole night by your side.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.530
Just the two of us.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.290
My darling Bell!

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:14.960
I can't believe it's actually happening! After all this time...!

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:18.420
Please refrain from punching the cameraman with your panties!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:25.840
Lady Hestia has been acting way out of line towards Master Bell lately.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.680
Whenever I ask what happened at the village in the mountains, she refuses to answer me...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.640
Am I supposed to sit back and let her do whatever she wants just because she's a goddess?!

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:36.560
Master Bell is going to pick Lili for sure.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:37.900
And then...!

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:38.560
Too late!

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:40.520
Master Bell...

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:45.320
Albeit small, Lili is a beautiful girl who hides her trauma underneath a tough exterior,

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:49.620
and the only people she isn't afraid to let see her cry are the ones closest to her...

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.200
Are you sure that's what you want?!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.160
Of course. I love you exactly the way you are, Lili.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:58.620
Master Bell...!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.170
Yes, yes! Perfect!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.090
Although I've volunteered to participate,

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:11.050
Master Bell would never grant his affections upon one such as I...

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.600
But I would be grateful if his kindness were to rub off on me!

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:15.930
Haruhime-dono...

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:19.350
When you say things like that, you risk gaining a reputation as a closeted pervert.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:23.820
If you wish to have Bell-dono, confronting him directly would be the wisest option.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:26.650
"Have" him...?

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.360
Mikoto, what are you implying...?

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:33.700
Master Bell, why haven't you brought a swimsuit with you?

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:37.410
I'm sorry, Miss Haruhime. But I don't need one.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.620
After all, we won't be wearing clothes for long.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.550
Collarbones... A gentleman...!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.010
It's the moment you've all been waiting for.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:53.470
In honor of our visit to Paradise Island: The Hestia Familia Swimsuit Competition!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.720
Welcome, ladies and gentlemen.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:00.900
My name is Welf, and I'll be your host for today's festivities!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:03.650
Make sure you rank 'em fairly.

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:04.730
Rank them? But-

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:05.900
Moving on!

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:09.990
In lieu of a practice round, let's kick off the competition with an unofficial participant!

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:17.450
Incredible!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:21.000
She may be ineligible to win, but her swimsuit is hideously lame!

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.080
Has a mystery of the Far East emerged

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.550
from the recesses of an old lady's closet before our very eyes?!

00:09:28.340 --> 00:09:31.970
The tacky style and form-fitting material work in tandem to accentuate her figure.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:35.350
Such an advanced approach is meant to appeal to the male psyche.

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:36.810
Very impressive, Miss Ryu!

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:38.470
I'm a lvl. 4.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:40.980
Moving on!

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:43.480
We will now begin the judging round.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:46.440
Please welcome our first official contestant to the stage!

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:50.400
Huh?

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.610
That's not a swimsuit...

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:55.280
There she is! A goddess, through and through!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:10:00.200
True to its name, Paradise Island has blessed us with a plump and bountiful harvest!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.370
Well? Whaddya think, Bell?

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:12.010
Tell me exactly how you feel. Don't hold back!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.470
I-I think you look nice...

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:17.390
Her large chest and small body are in stark contrast with one another.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:21.310
The use of leaves in place of a swimsuit strikes the perfect balance between flashy and lewd.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.810
It's so well-crafted that I wouldn't mind wearing it myself.

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:24.480
What?

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:28.150
Please welcome our next contestant!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.280
Incredible!

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:37.780
A key component of every good swimsuit competition!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:41.950
Going so far as to bring her own cheesy prop from home... The mark of a skilled tactician!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.290
An exercise in supply and demand, to be sure.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:48.920
Though childlike in some ways, there's a certain erotic charm to her shapelier features.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.380
Master Bell!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.730
Where did you even get that thing?

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:08.150
"Always be prepared" or whatever...

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.980
And now, please welcome our final contestant.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.530
Amazing!

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.240
What a sight for sore eyes!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:26.000
An ordinary swimsuit without any sort of gimmick in sight!

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:27.710
How simplistic...

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:28.920
The epitome of innocence!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.500
Posing as though forced to enter the competition by her friends!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:36.380
The more she shies away from the audience, the greater her appeal becomes. Even Bell can't resist!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:41.140
His eyes are glued to the spot, folks! Could this be the end?!

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.350
Objection!

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:44.060
Talk about underhanded!

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.810
You're being totally unfair, Haruhime!

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.690
H-have I done something wrong...?

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:51.020
That attitude is exactly what we're talking about!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.190
It wasn't my intention...

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.400
Y-you've got it wrong!

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:56.490
Haruhime-dono isn't nearly the closeted pervert you think she is!

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.820
C'mon, Bell! Time to decide the winner!

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:02.280
Huh? U-uh...

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.240
I'm the obvious choice, right?

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.160
Why not pick Lili, Master Bell?

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.920
If you don't mind one such as I...

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:10.000
Nope! He picks me!

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:11.210
W-well...

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.300
U-um, I think you all look nice...

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:17.930
Dodging the question by declaring everyone a winner after all that effort would be...

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:19.640
insulting at best.

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:20.300
Huh?

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:23.640
Ladies and gentlemen, it's the moment of truth!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:29.730
Which of our lucky contestants will get to keep Bell all to herself for an entire day?!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:43.910
Miss Ais...?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.080
What?!

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:50.670
I-incredible! The Sword Princess swoops in for the kill!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:53.130
An unexpected victory from a surprise opponent!

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.710
That's against the rules!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.090
She isn't even wearing a swimsuit!

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.590
But Bell has the final say...

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.300
Me and my Familia arrived here earlier today...

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:05.470
Hi! My name is Ais Wallenstein!

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:07.060
Tee-hee!

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.350
"Tee-hee"...?

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:17.440
After a quick examination,

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:22.410
it appears the Sword Princess has lost all of her memories outside of her own name.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.620
She's got amnesia, eh?

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.790
That explains the completely uncharacteristic smile...

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:31.670
More than likely, she fell over and hit her head on something.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.630
Judging by the swelling, at least.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:36.050
Surprised she managed a bump that big in broad daylight...

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:38.010
Only on Paradise Island, I suppose...

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.010
Check it out! A sea cucumber!

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.260
Gross!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.350
Come on, try it with me!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:46.890
Wha-?

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:50.480
U-um, Miss Ais... You shouldn't mess with living creatures...

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:53.520
Can't you do something about this, Miss Elf?

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:54.690
You dropped this...

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.110
If we don't bring the Sword Princess' memories back soon,

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:01.950
this could have a major effect on the balance of power between Familias!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:03.490
Tee-hee!

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:06.080
There is only one way to cure her:

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:10.290
The mysterious herb I mentioned earlier, the Everything Flower.

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:13.960
Having the herb in our possession should treat any ailment.

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.710
Keeping watch sure is boring...

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.420
I'm quite used to waiting, myself...

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:25.050
Listen, Wallen-whatsit...

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:26.680
What is it?

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:32.680
This may come as a shock to you, but before losing your memories, you were in love with someone.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.390
Oh! With who?!

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.310
It was...

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.320
the boy who went to search for herbs, Welf!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.650
Wow!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.780
Now I understand...

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:45.660
Wait, what's she talking about?!

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:47.200
Why would she say that?!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:51.160
That hunk in the swim trunks was my darling...?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:54.790
There's no guarantee whether this will have a lasting effect once her memories return...

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.330
What about the rabbit boy?

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:01.840
You ought to quit while you're ahead. The two of you would be a disaster together!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.430
Thank goodness you told me!

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:07.090
I'd never lie to you!

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:11.470
What a snake! A real goddess, through and through!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.480
Sure isn't easy to find, is it?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.900
Figured as much from this "mysterious" herb...

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:20.020
Let's take a break and check in with the others.

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:23.070
You're continuing on with the search, Ryu-dono?

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:24.030
Much appreciated.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:29.620
Welcome back, honey!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:41.630
Would you like a bath? How about dinner? Or perhaps... you'd like me?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:42.630
What?!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.340
The hell are you talking about?! Get away from me!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.630
No!

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:47.590
Don't touch me!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.800
I want to stay with my darling!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.640
W-W-Welf...

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.770
Since when are you and Miss Ais...?!

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.730
W-wait, Bell!

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:01.520
Welf, you jerk!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:05.530
You handsome, magic sword-hating blacksmith with your hunky swim trunks...!

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:06.990
He's gone!

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:12.870
Bell!

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.750
It appears I've gotten myself hopelessly lost...

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.500
And I haven't located the Everything Flower, either.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:23.250
Which direction leads back to the shore...?

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:27.930
This place...

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:33.180
Us Elves have an affinity for bathing in the forest, and this lake looks to be empty...

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.180
Could it be...?

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.230
The Everything Flower!

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.280
I-I suppose I've got no choice.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.030
In order to retrieve it, I must bathe in this lake.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.660
Mr. Cranel isn't around to spy on me this time...

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.670
He wouldn't do that, would he?

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.250
Certainly not...

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.630
You definitely aren't here, are you?

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:15.850
We can use this to help the Sword Princess...

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:19.600
Mr. Cranel?!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.730
Wasn't that Lady Ryu's voice?

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:25.820
Seriously?

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:28.030
What the heck is going on with this island?

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:31.910
Bell still hasn't woken up, and now Miss Elf...

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.160
I'll go check on her!

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:35.530
Let me come with you. It's dangerous to go alone.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:39.200
It should only take a moment. If I run into trouble, I'll turn back.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.710
Where on Earth has Ryu-dono gone?

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.670
This scent...

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.130
Impossible!

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:56.310
A secluded hot spring in the middle of the forest, rife with health benefits?!

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.310
Could it be...?

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.810
The Everything Flower?!

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:08.530
I-I suppose I've got no choice.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.940
In order to retrieve it, I must take a dip in this hot spring!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.370
What a nice-

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:20.950
Wasn't that Mikoto's voice?!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.250
Again?

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.790
No way... Lady Mikoto, too?

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:27.590
Lady Hestia... I'll go investigate.

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:30.090
Hold on, Welf. If something were to happen...

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:34.380
Don't worry. If I sense any sort of danger, I'll come back.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:39.010
That's exactly what Mikoto said...

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.440
Could this foreshadowing get any more obvious...?

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.110
What the...?

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:57.910
A glowing forge with the perfect setup and no one else around...

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.370
I knew it!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:06.120
Hello!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.340
I am Ryu!

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:09.960
I am Mikoto!

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:12.260
And I am Ganesha!

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:16.220
Look... They've all got bumps on their heads!

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.890
Just like Wallen-whatsit...

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:22.220
"You gotta be kiddin' me!"

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:25.350
And now they're behaving just like her, too...

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:28.190
Check it out! A sea cucumber!

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:30.730
Gross!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.320
The symptoms are exactly the same!

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:36.780
They must've fallen and hit their heads like the Sword Princess...

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:39.280
We can't rely on them anymore...

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:42.040
There's only one thing left to do!

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.210
We have to search for the Everything Flower ourselves!

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:48.920
Track it down and save everyone's butts!

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:55.720
Failure is not an option! Bell is our top priority!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.560
"You gotta be kiddin' me!"

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.900
"You gotta be kiddin' me!"

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:12.110
Miss Ais...?

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:13.610
Huh?

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:14.940
What?

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.150
What?!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:21.490
N-no... Goddess...

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:24.540
It can't be...

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:28.420
Everyone met the same fate as Miss Ais while I was unconscious?!

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:31.000
Check it out! A sea cucumber!

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:33.750
Gross!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.380
The symptoms are exactly the same!

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.880
Wh-why is this happening?

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:45.270
Everyone must've hit their heads on something and lost their memories like Miss Ais...

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.480
Throw a big ol' slab on the grill!

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:52.440
Cook 'em up nice 'n juicy!

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:56.860
It's as if they've turned into completely different people...

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:14.420
Time to toss the sea cucumbers!

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:20.300
Check it out! A sea cucumber!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.140
Gross!

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:28.560
G-Goddess... Lili...

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:31.730
Miss Ais!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.770
Get ahold of yourself, Miss Ais!

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.240
Bell? Is that you?

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:44.570
Her bump...

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:47.290
A mushroom?

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:50.460
Bell!

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:51.330
Miss Ais?!

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:53.580
Bell? Is that you, Bell?

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.920
Master Bell... Oh, how I've missed you...

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:57.000
Mr. Cranel?

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:01.880
There has to be some sort of mistake!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.760
Miss Ais can't turn into a mushroom! It's not possible!

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:06.100
Hey! Calm down, Bell!

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:08.060
Bell-dono!

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:13.480
Bell... That hurts.

00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:19.440
I-I'm sorry...

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:24.030
Bell, it seems we're no longer gods nor humans.

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:26.280
Somehow, we've been turned into mushroom creatures!

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:28.660
Goddess...

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:32.960
We might be stuck in these bodies for the rest of our lives...

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:37.880
But the thought of rotting away on this island in the middle of nowhere is too agonizing to bear!

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:38.920
Please, Bell...

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:42.630
Bring us home. Let us see the sunshine in Orario!

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:45.050
I know we can count on you, Bell-dono!

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:47.390
I beg of you, Mr. Cranel...

00:22:49.100 --> 00:22:50.140
Save us!

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:52.310
You're right...

00:22:52.310 --> 00:22:55.600
My friends are my friends, whether they're mushrooms or not!

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:58.610
I swear I'll bring you back to Orario safely!

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:03.240
And how do you plan on doing that, Bell Cranel?

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:05.740
Mr. Finn! What are you doing here?!

00:23:05.740 --> 00:23:08.830
A mushroom is a mushroom, regardless of the circumstances...

00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:13.540
And I will destroy every last one!

00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:15.290
Back off, you damn mushrooms!

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:17.540
Quit your shouting, lowly little mushrooms!

00:23:18.340 --> 00:23:22.260
Ooh, these mushrooms seem a little wound up.

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.640
What do you think of that?! I'm going to take your sweet mushrooms all for myself!

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:32.890
Let the mighty Kingdom of Rakia strike fear into the hearts of Orario's mushrooms!

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:35.100
E-everyone else, too?!

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:38.060
These mushrooms are mine!

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:40.230
I'm bringing them back home to Orario with me!

00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:43.690
For what reason would we submit to the whims of a child?

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:45.240
Onward!

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:48.950
Where did that mountain come from?!

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.120
It can't be...!

00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:15.390
Another... vision?

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:18.480
Another vision?!

00:24:19.980 --> 00:24:22.520
Oh Cassandra, what a strange child you are.

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:23.900
C'mon, Daphne!

00:24:23.900 --> 00:24:26.280
I really, really mean it this time!

00:24:26.280 --> 00:24:30.780
Be that as it may, Bell and the others set out to complete the quest several days ago.

00:24:30.950 --> 00:24:31.780
What?

00:24:32.160 --> 00:24:34.040
They're due to return soon.

00:24:34.040 --> 00:24:34.740
What?!

00:24:34.910 --> 00:24:36.120
Don't you remember?

00:24:36.710 --> 00:24:40.500
Cassandra, you've been asleep for nearly a week.

00:24:46.090 --> 00:24:48.430
Oh! Good to see you, Bell.

00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:50.590
Welcome.

00:24:50.930 --> 00:24:53.300
You must be exhausted from such a long journey.

00:24:53.930 --> 00:24:54.930
Have a seat, Bell.

00:24:54.930 --> 00:24:57.270
Tell us the riveting tale of your visit to Paradise Island.
